Module(
  body=[
    Expr(
      value=Constant(value='\nUnified L1 Cognition Layer (v10_9) — FULL AGENTIC PLANNING (REFINED)\n\nThis module implements ALL L1 responsibilities for the v10_9 agentic\nworkflow. It is strictly *cognition-only*:\n\n    • Performs profile inference (seniority, domain, skills).\n    • Estimates task complexity and selects reasoning mode (CoT vs ToT).\n    • Builds linear strategy plans (clarify → context → structure).\n    • Plans RAG intents (queries, evidence targets, sources).\n    • Plans drafting structure (sections, tone, personalization).\n    • Plans bullet frameworks (action–metric–outcome; seniority scaling).\n    • Plans QA and safety surfaces (checks, hints, escalation paths).\n    • Plans meta-learning signals and logging surfaces.\n    • Plans prompt-engineering constraints and governance hooks.\n\nL1 DOES NOT:\n\n    • Call tools, databases, or LLMs.\n    • Execute retrieval, drafting, QA, or safety checks.\n    • Perform orchestration / control-flow.\n    • Mutate global state or storage.\n    • Make final safety/policy decisions.\n\nAdditionally, L1 now **consumes META profile biases** from `meta_profile`\nto adapt its planning:\n\n    • routing_bias    → complexity and RAG planning preferences.\n    • planning_bias   → conservative/exploratory reasoning choices.\n    • qa_bias         → QA-heavy vs standard planning.\n    • safety_bias     → safety/sensitivity emphasis.\n\nThis file is designed to restore full planning capabilities from v10_8,\nwhile respecting the v10_9 layered agentic architecture and maximizing\nscores on the 14 OpenAI agentic subdomains.\n')),
    ImportFrom(
      module='__future__',
      names=[
        alias(name='annotations')],
      level=0),
    ImportFrom(
      module='dataclasses',
      names=[
        alias(name='dataclass'),
        alias(name='field'),
        alias(name='asdict')],
      level=0),
    ImportFrom(
      module='enum',
      names=[
        alias(name='Enum')],
      level=0),
    ImportFrom(
      module='typing',
      names=[
        alias(name='Any'),
        alias(name='Dict'),
        alias(name='List'),
        alias(name='Optional'),
        alias(name='Sequence'),
        alias(name='Tuple')],
      level=0),
    ImportFrom(
      module='models',
      names=[
        alias(name='PlanObject'),
        alias(name='FramingProfile'),
        alias(name='ContextProfile'),
        alias(name='ToolingProfile'),
        alias(name='SafetyOutputProfile'),
        alias(name='AccessPolicy'),
        alias(name='SelfCorrectionSurface')],
      level=0),
    ImportFrom(
      module='meta_profile',
      names=[
        alias(name='get_routing_bias'),
        alias(name='get_planning_bias'),
        alias(name='get_qa_bias'),
        alias(name='get_safety_bias')],
      level=0),
